"P2982911302" "One of the Tuatha you defeated gasped: 'Are you working for the Red Caps? They seem bent on making us miserable, ever since they brought us here to fight the Fir Bolg!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1587817103" "I'm not sure if this gets us any closer to freeing the ghosts, but at least we are beginning to piece together the great puzzle that is Croatoa. I never realized that the Tuatha were recent additions to the spirit world. I do know that last Halloween, the Banished Pantheon performed a great ritual that allowed the Fir Bolg to walk the real world for a brief time. I suppose that's what made the Red Caps enlist the Tuatha. They wanted to make certain that the Fir Bolg they had imprisoned remained under their control, and so they resurrected a terrible war!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1927226546" "I hear {HeroName}'s really learning a lot about Croatoa."
